From 0f7a269836971344e10da511f0fcdec41bd4efab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KupipiKuki <masterkookus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:46:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] HO-STRATA-015: DeepSeek S4b MoE blocks 1-27 (WIP)

- All 28 layers load; block 0 dense FFN preserved.
- MoE block implemented for layers 1-27:
  * router ffn_gate_inp, softmax over 64 experts
  * top-6 with no renormalisation over selected set
  * 64 routed experts (gate/up/down)
  * 2 shared experts always active, placed inside FFN branch
- Memory refactor: keep quantised bytes resident, dequant per matvec into
  a reused f32 scratch; spot-check asserts device dequant equals direct
  host dequant per quant type.
- Geometry assertions added (28/2048/16/16/64/6/2/1408/1/1e4/1e-6).
- F2 CLI fix: --parity-run without --dump-layers is now refused for every
  family, including supported models; unit test added.
- model_family_test and gguf_geometry_test green.

The parity gate (AC-5b) has NOT been run yet.
