 teacher-forced gate
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Behind STRATA_DEEPSEEK_DIAG (not defined in normal builds):

- --parity-teacher-force INPUTS,KV,OUTPUTS,ORACLE runs each (layer, position)
  cell in isolation: inject the reference residual for that cell, preload the
  reference K/V history for positions < p, run exactly block l, and write the
  output to a [layer][position][hidden] file.
- Before every cell the injected residual is asserted against the oracle slot
  it claims to come from (max abs diff ≤ 1e-6; observed 0.0).
- --parity-inject / --parity-run-block are kept for single-block diagnostics.

Normal builds remain free-running only.
